	(text "ESP32-C6-WROOM-1 (8 MB flash, PCB antenna)\nAntenna end at a board edge or the star's open centre: no copper on any layer under\nand around it (Espressif hardware design guidelines). EPAD to ground (thermal).\nLED data uses I2S or RMT in the firmware: SPI2 serves the NAND."
